        <section id="impact-of-cyber-crime-and-why-cyber-security-is-important?"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
            <h2>Impact of cyber crime and why cyber security is important?</h2>
              <p>Cyber attacks are financially devastating, disrupting and upsetting to individuals and businesses and can impact us all directly or indirectly. Directly it may affect us by having a lapse of concentration and clicking on a bogus link, or by our employers being hacked and affecting our jobs. It may also affect us as part of a community or nationally as it can impact our way of life.</p>

          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
  
