        <section id="the-importance-of-reporting-cyber-security-issues-promptly"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
            <h2>The importance of reporting cyber security issues promptly</h2>
              <p>General reporting of cyber security incidents informs the public as well as businesses. It can help individuals to look out for suspicious activity, such as money disappearing from their bank accounts, and enables them to take steps to protect themselves. Being aware of scams that are going around such as bogus texts and emails make people more aware and more likely to double check authenticity. Notification can also help other companies and organisations to be prepared for similar attacks.</p>

          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
  
        <section id="watch"  class="t-bg-grey i-watch">
          
            <h2>
    
    <!-- THEME ICON MACRO watch -->
    <svg viewBox="0 0 232.18 168.39" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" ><path d="m0 146v16.58a5.77 5.77 0 0 0 5.78 5.78h220.58a5.78 5.78 0 0 0 5.78-5.78v-16.58z" fill="#00a6e0"/><path d="m232.18 146.21v-140.43a5.78 5.78 0 0 0 -5.78-5.78h-220.59a5.78 5.78 0 0 0 -5.81 5.78v140.43z" fill="#00a6e0"/><path d="m9.54 9.31h213.13v127.59h-213.13z" fill="#4a4f55"/><ellipse cx="116.11" cy="71.74" fill="#ddf2fb" rx="40.37" ry="40.15"/><path d="m116.11 112.57a40.83 40.83 0 1 1 41.05-40.83 41 41 0 0 1 -41.05 40.83zm0-80.3a39.47 39.47 0 1 0 39.68 39.47 39.62 39.62 0 0 0 -39.68-39.47z" fill="#32b6eb"/><path d="m101.03 98.26v-50.32l43.81 25.16z" fill="#00a6e0"/></svg>
